abstract: >-
  beal-conjecture v28 port of foundations v0.28-mcom-algebraic-props-inhabited
  at a93402e. Honest slice Level26/HonestB0Search/ adds Tate 928=2^5*29,
  Mazur cusp Finset card=2, Ribet matching Finset card=0, and
  Nonempty(Fintype)->Fintype with |Sel2|=1, L/Ω=1/3 and 1/7,
  ¬IsRankZero. Parent Tate algorithm / Néron, {2 cusps}=X0(13)(Q),
  Sage new_subspace dim=0, and MW_rank_zero_fintype stay def Prop.
  Vendor unchanged db7a556/fea0c393, no nested Level26, path-requires.
  Matveev C1=143186215390 B0=10^6. Concept DOI
  10.5281/zenodo.22379293. Prior v27 version DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22842767
  at 4b4d6f8 / 6ccafbf. Prior v26 version DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22832505
  at 5e2906b / 5806dad. Prior software version v11.0.0
  (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22281075).
